{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14303322","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14303322","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1430332201:1":{"text":"저도 이 돌을 부숴서 집을 지으면 어떨까 생각은 했었죠.","source_cn":"我刚开始也打算把这石头敲碎，拿回家盖房子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36A6CFAEE1F11FC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1430332202:1":{"text":"그런데 생각보다 엄청 크고 단단해서 몇 번이나 시도했지만 도저히 깨지질 않아서 포기할 수밖에 없었어요.","source_cn":"可这石头不但大，还很硬，我尝试了几次敲不碎，只能放弃。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8835195FB6EE7BBD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:平民拉特":{"text":"평민 라트","source":"平民拉特","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":1}}